    <h2>What we check</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>The service, meter base and panel, including breaker sizes against wire sizes.</li>
        <li>Grounding and bonding, including water and gas lines.</li>
        <li>GFCI and AFCI protection where the code expects it.</li>
        <li>A sample of outlets and switches in every room, tested for polarity and ground.</li>
        <li>Attic, basement and garage wiring for damage, splices and DIY work.</li>
        <li>Smoke and carbon monoxide alarms: location, age and interconnection.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Buying a house?</h2>
    <p>Book us inside your inspection window. A report with prices attached is a strong position to negotiate from, and it tells you what to budget for in the first year.</p>
</ServicePage>
